title: "LaTeX source and verification code for the paper Algebraic Loci of Weil Classes on Abelian Varieties"
abstract: "The complete LaTeX source of the paper of the same name, with its figures and the compiled PDF, together with exact-arithmetic verification code, a kernel-checked Lean 4 certificate of the finite arithmetic, Macaulay2 computations and the generators and TikZ sources of every figure."
